-- UI: Robly Airflow (Robscript theme), loaded from GitHub on start.
--
-- How this works (reverse-engineered from the game client):
--   * GameState (ReplicatedStorage.GameState) — round attributes:
--       State (Playing / Intermission), TimeLeft, Alive, MapName, Rally,
--       Rush, SuddenDeath, BallState (Loose / Held / Live),
--       HolderId, FlightTarget, TargetId.
--   * Remotes (ReplicatedStorage.DodgeShared.Remotes):
--       RequestCharge(true|false)  — start the wind-up
--       RequestThrow(power, dir, curve, targetUserId) — throw
--       RequestCatch(eta)          — catch attempt
--       RequestPickup()            — pick up a loose ball
--       RequestDodge(animName)     — dodge
--       RequestSkill()             — skill (Dash by default)
--       RequestJoin()              — join the next round
--       ClaimDaily()               — RemoteFunction, daily reward
--   * Player attributes: HP, Hearts, Alive, InRound, Coins, RankRP, EquippedSkill.
--   * Targets: Models in workspace with attribute InGame == true.
--
-- NOTE: every combat feature is OFF by default. The server tracks who holds
-- the ball (HolderId) and who is alive (Alive), so some features only work
-- while you are in a round and holding the ball.

